  "whole_refresh_method": "Nine alternated triples, independent newly generated temporary files and own database per launch. Exact released and candidate collector.refresh implementations compiled optimized with reachable dependencies. The separate unrelated analyticsSnapshot method is omitted to avoid any external catalog access. First pass parses 0/1/16/128 synthetic JSONL files, following 11 passes read unchanged checkpoints. Within each trial normal source count, bytes processed, total tokens, quality and hasMoreWork agree. Additional 48 interleaved pairs for 0/1/16 isolate tiny fluctuations. No whole app/UI startup, network, real accounts, real history or physical Intel desktop.",
  "qualifications": [
    "Warm 16–128 file collector improves on both targets. One-source or zero-source numbers fluctuate; the empty collector never invokes checkpoint().",
    "Cold first import interleaves writes and frequently reparses the read statement; a consistent cold improvement over the immediately preceding implementation was not demonstrated.",
    "Operator attestation requires interactive terminal and native check adapter is unavailable. Formal gate remains INCONCLUSIVE."
  ],
  "formal": "INCONCLUSIVE",
